%% CloudWatch alarm state machine
%% Author: Prem Vishnoi <prem.vishnoi@example.com>
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INSUFFICIENT_DATA : alarm created
    INSUFFICIENT_DATA --> OK : first valid<br/>datapoint below threshold
    INSUFFICIENT_DATA --> ALARM : first valid<br/>datapoint at/above threshold
    INSUFFICIENT_DATA --> INSUFFICIENT_DATA : no datapoints<br/>(period elapsed)

    OK --> ALARM : m-of-n datapoints<br/>breach threshold
    ALARM --> OK : m-of-n datapoints<br/>back below threshold

    OK --> INSUFFICIENT_DATA : datapoint(s) missing<br/>(treat as missing)
    ALARM --> INSUFFICIENT_DATA : datapoint(s) missing
    INSUFFICIENT_DATA --> INSUFFICIENT_DATA : extended outage

    ALARM --> OK : manual reset (set-state)
    OK --> ALARM : manual reset (set-state)

    note right of OK
        Metric is healthy.
        No actions fire.
    end note

    note right of ALARM
        Threshold breach.
        AlarmActions fire
        (SNS, ASG, Lambda).
    end note

    note right of INSUFFICIENT_DATA
        No datapoints OR
        not enough datapoints
        to evaluate the
        m-of-n rule.
    end note
